sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as CLI or TUI
    participant App as SfumatoApplication
    participant Workflow as GenerateVideo
    participant Prompts as PromptCatalog
    participant Draft as Text planner
    participant Review as Reviewer
    participant Code as Code model
    participant Remote as VideoGenerationProvider
    participant Local as VideoRenderer
    participant Probe as ffprobe
    participant Store as ArtifactStore
    participant Publish as WorkspaceFileSystem

    User->>UI: generate video --engine ... --duration ...
    UI->>App: GenerateVideoCommand
    App->>Workflow: effective config and outbound ports
    Workflow->>Prompts: route workflow; render design, storyboard, and plan templates
    Workflow->>Draft: plan with filesystem and optional image tool
    Draft-->>Workflow: VideoPlanDocument JSON
    opt review enabled
        Workflow->>Review: revision snapshot
        Review-->>Workflow: RFC 6902 plan patch
    end
    alt engine is model
        Workflow->>Remote: validated prompt, options, and supported references
        Remote-->>Workflow: downloaded MP4
    else engine is Hyperframes or Manim
        Workflow->>Prompts: render engine authoring templates
        Workflow->>Code: reviewed plan and exact renderer contract
        Code-->>Workflow: VideoSourceDocument JSON
        Workflow->>Local: static validation and deterministic snapshots
        opt visual review requested
            Workflow-->>UI: persist review session, publish root, and contact sheet
            User->>UI: approve exact review session
        end
        Workflow->>Local: render approved source
        opt validation or render fails and review is enabled
            Workflow->>Review: source snapshot and exact error
            Review-->>Workflow: focused RFC 6902 source patch
            Workflow->>Local: validate and render once more
        end
    end
    Workflow->>Probe: validate codec, dimensions, duration, and audio
    Workflow->>Store: commit plan, storyboard, source/assets, and MP4
    opt output directory selected, saved with review, or overridden on approval
        Workflow->>Publish: atomically publish only slug/slug.mp4
    end
    Workflow-->>UI: GenerateVideoResult, provenance, review, and warnings
